<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_18_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_19_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g2" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_20_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g3" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_21_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g4" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_22_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g5" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_23_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g6" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_24_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g7" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_25_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g8" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_3"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_26_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g9" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_27_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g10" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_2"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14187v1/layer_28_p_value.svg" id="A3.F8.g11" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_figure_panel ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:153/115;" width="153" height="115"></object></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Layer-wise motivation-experiment results for layers 18–28. Each subplot reports the <math id="A3.F8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>p</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p</annotation></semantics></math>-value statistics before and after coordinate whitening for the corresponding layer.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">C.2 </span>Learning-rate Sensitivity Results on Qwen3-0.6B</h3>

<div id="A3.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this subsection, we supplement the learning-rate tuning results for Qwen3-0.6B. Table <a href="#A3.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ C.2 Learning-rate Sensitivity Results on Qwen3-0.6B ‣ Appendix C More Experimental Results ‣ Zeta: Dual Whitening for Matrix Optimization via Coordinate-Adaptive Preconditioning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> reports the final training loss under different learning rates, and Figure <a href="#A3.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ C.2 Learning-rate Sensitivity Results on Qwen3-0.6B ‣ Appendix C More Experimental Results ‣ Zeta: Dual Whitening for Matrix Optimization via Coordinate-Adaptive Preconditioning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> shows the corresponding training curves. Together, these results allow us to assess whether Zeta preserves its optimization advantage over a broader range of step sizes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A3.T5" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 5: </span>Training loss on Qwen3-0.6B under different learning rates. Lower is better.</figcaption>
<table id="A3.T5.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A3.T5.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt">Optimizer</th>
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9\times 10^{-4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9\times 10^{-4}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="3\times 10^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">3\times 10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A3.T5.2.1.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><math id="A3.T5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9\times 10^{-3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9\times 10^{-3}</annotation></semantics></math></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A3.T5.2.2" class="ltx_tr">
